; This station's card on a stick, for a keymaster met in person.
FORM CARD_SAVE
TITLE Put your card on a stick
SUMMARY Writes your station card to a file, for a keymaster or net control you meet in person. Read them your fingerprint while you're there.
LEVEL ZERO
ORDER 23
ACTION station_card
FIELD out Write it to(X) required check=path
BEGIN_HELP
Write it to:
A file on a stick, such as /media/stick/MY-CARD.TXT.
END
